---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/config/site';

const lastUpdated = "4 November 2026";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy notice"
  subtitle="Privacy & ethics"
  description="This website is built with an explicit privacy-first architecture: static hosting, no tracking scripts, no medical data collection, and no advertising cookies."
>
  <div class="space-y-8 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-body max-w-[38rem]">
    <div class="py-2 border-b border-rule text-xs text-fg-muted">
      <strong>Last updated:</strong> {lastUpdated}
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-normal text-fg">
        1. Core privacy philosophy
      </h2>
      <p>
        This personal research website exists to publish independent inquiries, literature reviews, and UX reflections. It is intentionally engineered as a static site to minimise data exposure and eliminate surveillance.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm">
        <li><strong>No health or medical data collection:</strong> I do not ask for, collect, or process personal medical histories, symptom diaries, or health records.</li>
        <li><strong>No third-party advertising trackers:</strong> There are no advertising pixels, behavioural marketing scripts, or tracking cookies installed.</li>
        <li><strong>No user accounts:</strong> Visitors do not need to register, create accounts, or log in to read published research.</li>
        <li><strong>No external font CDN connections:</strong> Fonts are hosted locally to prevent third-party logging of visitor IP addresses.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-normal text-fg">
        2. Technical logs
      </h2>
      <p>
        When you visit this website, the hosting infrastructure automatically logs standard network requests (such as your IP address, browser user-agent, and requested file URL) solely for operational reliability, security, and network routing.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-normal text-fg">
        3. Local storage for theme preference
      </h2>
      <p>
        This site uses browser <code>localStorage</code> solely to remember your chosen theme mode (light or dark). This is stored locally on your device and is never transmitted to any external server.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-normal text-fg">
        4. Direct communication via email and LinkedIn
      </h2>
      <p>
        To avoid collecting sensitive information through unencrypted web forms, this website does not include online submission forms. When you contact me using direct email or via LinkedIn, you choose what information to share.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs text-fg-muted italic">
        Reminder: Please do not include confidential clinical records or personal medical histories in email correspondence.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-normal text-fg">
        5. Contact information for privacy inquiries
      </h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions regarding this privacy statement, you may contact:
      </p>
      <p class="font-sans text-sm">
        {SITE.author.name}{!SITE.author.email.includes("TO CONFIRM") && <> · <a href={`mailto:${SITE.author.email}`} class="text-link underline underline-offset-2">{SITE.author.email}</a></>}
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
